}^{∗}{\\int }_{a}^{b}{\\int }_{∗}^{∗}f(x,y,z)\\,dy\\,dx\\,dz\n$$\n\nGiven that the triple integral above is considered over the rectangular box\n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,-2\\le x\\le 3,\\,0\\le y\\le e,\\,1\\le z\\le \\operatorname{ln}⁡3},\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $a+b?$" :question/worked-solution "Writing down our triple integral as a repeated integral, we obtain\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{1}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{\\int }_{-2}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{e}f(x,y,z)\\,dy\\,dx\\,dz.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a+b=-2+3=1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-161334/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6d3a0d58-20a3-570d-91e7-aa8f10dafb5a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-161334"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-39541/selection/41737df828df1e8002339d0e0b9b254aa17f9f0272cc3b9fea8203d310429ebd" :answer/id #uuid "dde7a15c-28ae-5d15-b4fd-ba56a6c7a7ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{1}^{2\\sqrt{3}}{\\int }_{2}^{3}{\\int }_{-3}^{-2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{y{x}^{3}({z}^{2}-1)}}\\,\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39541/selection/18b25d8681d5ac3c4f6bba1bdd9fd0b11ad0645e81767e71d03ec35e56acdd9a" :answer/id #uuid "19305c9f-184c-5c60-9bc9-401195516761" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{2}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{2\\sqrt{3}}{\\int }_{-3}^{-2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{y{x}^{3}({z}^{2}-1)}}\\,\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39541/selection/179003cb7e1e61dd52bd07cacbb39de52e6de753d1793f79fc91adca3f58f16d" :answer/id #uuid "c9befddf-6db5-5d22-8f1c-c41b35f1f4ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{2}^{3}{\\int }_{-2}^{2\\sqrt{3}}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{y{x}^{3}({z}^{2}-1)}}\\,\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39541/selection/4e3614901a1d6cb3a19617a3e8eac0b9b9aabf30d975eed1303226b376cb